+// alone while a window holds a tab group of loose tabs (windows G10); the
+// archive's Restore into a folder that has changed since (archive A9); a
+// little window open at a quit (archive A13, A15); and a closed window's tabs
+// of the profile's pins (archive A9, windows G16).
