+// What a page opened from a Space with its own session keeps from the frame
+// that opened it (docs/features/sessions.md S11), and how a pin's records
+// hold up when its page closes itself and when a restored window comes back
+// after the store was filled (docs/features/windows.md G15, G18, G19).
