+// Seven checks of the welcome flow (docs/features/welcome.md,
+// docs/features/import.md): step 3 shows the profile's own scheme and Space
+// colour; Safari's Import waits while another export is chosen; the
+// importer's button speaks for the source chosen; a redraw keeps the step's
+// scroll; the quiet first focus stays quiet through the late answers, and a
+// keyboard ring survives a redraw made in another window; and
+// the English text keeps its order under a right-to-left interface.
+
