+// pass 2 MiB are read; a refresh leaves the folder where it is in its Space's
+// pins when one of its rows was sent to an earlier Space; and the last row of
+// the folder going keeps the folder while another row of it sits outside.
+// Every request is answered here, from built and recorded answers; nothing
+// reaches the network.
