+// Sync through a folder or a place (docs/features/sidebar-file.md), as a
+// person uses it: Sf27, Sf30, Sf31, Sf34, a computer whose file leaves the
+// folder is no longer named in a warning or the list of computers; Sf9,
+// Sf49, the sheet a Settings page answers is the one it showed; Sf43, Sf47,
+// a test of a place cancelled before Stop syncing leaves the next test free;
+// Sf35, Undo removes again an item a batch brought back from a removal. A
+// folder in a temporary directory stands for the shared one, and another
+// computer's file is written into it by the test; a place is a server in
+// memory behind an embedded test server.
