+// the strip's watchers the sidebar is collapsing, as a plain ⌘S does
+// (sidebar panels Pn4); a lock that holds the rail closed also ends its
+// pause (sidebar Y11); right to left, the reveal edge keeps out from under
+// Windows' caption buttons on the side they are on (sidebar Y39, Y43); and a
+// Space chip's floating name sits over the chip under the pointer in either
+// direction (sidebar Y14).
