+
+// docs/features/peek.md P18, P22: a press held on a pinned page peeks the
+// link it follows, when the server redirects that link late and when the
+// press is on a frame from another site. docs/features/spaces.md B43: Edit
+// Space's hex field takes a hex colour and nothing else.
+
+#include <memory>
